{"ref":"BDB, לִמֻּד","hw":"לִמֻּד","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">לִמֻּד</span></big>  <strong>adj. taught</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמּוּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.4\">Is 50:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמּוּדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.13\">Is 54:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמֻּדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.23\">Je 13:23</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמֻּדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.16\">Is 8:16</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>taught</em>, as disciples <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.16\">Is 8:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.4\">50:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.13\">54:13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>accustomed to</em> something, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמֻּד מִדְבָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a> (wild ass) <em>accustomed to the wilderness;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמֻּדֵי הָרֵעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.23\">13:23</a> <em>accustomed to do evil</em>.","next":"BDB, מַלְמָד","prev":"BDB, לָמַד"}